&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.1080/02673843.2025.2608766&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.1080/02673843.2025.2608766&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh Duc&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Duc&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh Duc&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Thu Dau Mot University&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;International Journal of Adolescence and Youth&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;31&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Taylor &amp; Francis&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S15&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S15]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S17&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;ee8ba2a6-8919-289d-c6c6-db153a2a7a3d&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7112829116&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7112829116&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The influence of TikTok on academic performance among university students at UiTM Alor Gajah, Melaka&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ir.uitm.edu.my/id/eprint/123523/1/123523.pdf&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:null,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Mat Said, Siti Hajar, Ahmad Hisham, Widad Nasuha, Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah, Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis, Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi, Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah, Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hajar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mat Said, Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nasuha&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ahmad Hisham, Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hussar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Anuar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sarudin&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hassan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;UiTM Institutional Repositories (Universiti Teknologi MARA)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universiti Teknologi MARA&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S17]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Ciroma, Abubakar and Bashir, 2025; Duc, 2025; Hajar et al., 2025; Joshi and Singh, 2025; Chaudhary, 2026)</cite>.</p><p>Despite the growing body of literature examining social media use, time management, and academic performance, there remains a need for a comprehensive synthesis that delineates the specific pathways through which these variables interact and how these interactions manifest across diverse student populations. Previous research has often focused on specific aspects, such as social media addiction <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="7176dffa-2140-499d-8b59-fd07c2d2c1e9" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S9&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S9&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;10cf1867-0020-fae6-1342-ab8dce07fad9&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W4411204892&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W4411204892&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Social Media Addiction and Academic Performance of University Students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;http://uijournal.usim.edu.my/index.php/uij/article/download/476/305&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.33102/uij.vol34no2.476&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Fatin Najihah Basri, Farhana Sabri, Mohd Khairul Anuar Rahimi&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Basri&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Fatin Najihah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Fatin Najihah Basri&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universiti Sains Islam Malaysia&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sabri&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Farhana&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Farhana Sabri&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3177-3084&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universiti Sains Islam Malaysia&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Rahimi&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Khairul Anuar&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mohd Khairul Anuar Rahimi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universiti Sains Islam Malaysia&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2022,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Ulum Islamiyyah&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;34&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;1-17&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universiti Sains Islam Malaysia&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S9&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S9]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S15&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S15&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;709df0c1-a94e-2623-9c06-ec42b7fd7158&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7117361642&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7117361642&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Excessive social media use and its impact on psychological well-being and academic performance of Vietnamese university students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.1080/02673843.2025.2608766&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.1080/02673843.2025.2608766&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh Duc&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Duc&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh Duc&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Thu Dau Mot University&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;International Journal of Adolescence and Youth&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;31&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Taylor &amp; Francis&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S15&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S15]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S20&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S20&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;72052be1-1693-9573-3fc3-1b3516addd04&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W2800281014&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W2800281014&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;SOCIAL MEDIA ADDICTION AND ACADEMIC ENGAGEMENT AMONG UNDERGRADUATE STUDENTS OF USMANU DANFODIYO UNIVERSITY SOKOTO, NIGERIA&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ijitie.aitie.org.ng/index.php/ijitie/article/download/55/30&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:null,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Zubairu Suleiman&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Suleiman&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Zubairu&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Zubairu Suleiman&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Gombe State University&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2017,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;International Journal of Innovative Technology Integration in Education&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;39-46&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S20&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S20]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Suleiman, 2017; Basri, Sabri and Rahimi, 2022; Duc, 2025)</cite> or the influence of particular platforms <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="e655ba56-cb69-495b-8792-8e467bfb6746" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S17&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;ee8ba2a6-8919-289d-c6c6-db153a2a7a3d&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7112829116&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7112829116&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The influence of TikTok on academic performance among university students at UiTM Alor Gajah, Melaka&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ir.uitm.edu.my/id/eprint/123523/1/123523.pdf&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:null,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Mat Said, Siti Hajar, Ahmad Hisham, Widad Nasuha, Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah, Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis, Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi, Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah, Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hajar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mat Said, Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nasuha&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ahmad Hisham, Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hussar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Anuar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sarudin&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hassan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;UiTM Institutional Repositories (Universiti Teknologi MARA)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universiti Teknologi MARA&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S17]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Hajar et al., 2025)</cite>. While some studies acknowledge the role of time management <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="7adf0130-1125-4b4b-9c7d-dcd97f026137" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S3&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S3&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;b61186cc-2965-3b5d-70e0-de17b70d7e2d&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7129271745&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7129271745&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Productive and Problematic Social Media Use and Students’ Academic Outcomes: Mediation by Parent/Teacher Support and Moderation by Time Management Skills (Evidence from Higher Education Institutions in Punjab and Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan)&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://rjsaonline.com/journals/index.php/rjsa/article/download/715/893&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.71317/rjsa.003.06.0715&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Najma Tauheed, Muhammad Aslam Khan, Muhammad Siddique, Hafiz Safi Ullah, Haji Irfan Haider, Mahesh Kumar Oad&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Tauheed&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Najma&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Najma Tauheed&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Aslam&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Aslam Khan&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6219-3918&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Haripur&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Siddique&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Siddique&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Gomal University&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ullah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Hafiz Safi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hafiz Safi Ullah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Gomal University&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Haider&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Haji Irfan&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Haji Irfan Haider&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Gomal University&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Oad&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mahesh Kumar&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mahesh Kumar Oad&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sindh&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Research Journal for Social Affairs&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;6&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;1847-1856&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S3&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S3]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S4&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;4286b9f9-2462-9531-fc7d-9ff6094dcb6c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7164532107&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7164532107&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Influence of Social Media Usage on Students&#39; Academic Performance and Study Habits&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Saroj&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;European Organization for Nuclear Research&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S4]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S5&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S5&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;40107c2c-646d-7872-050b-107a4a66b1e9&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W2992858501&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W2992858501&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Revealing the Relationship between Smartphone Addiction and Academic Performance of Students: Evidences from Higher Educational Institutes of Pakistan&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W2992858501&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:null,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam Khan, Asma Khalid, Rimsha Iqbal&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam Khan&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khalid&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Asma&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Asma Khalid&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3919-2487&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Iqbal&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Rimsha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rimsha Iqbal&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4685-2834&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2019,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Social Science Open Access Repository (GESIS – Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;74-83&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;GESIS - Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S5&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S5]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Tauheed et al., 2025; Chaudhary, 2026)</cite>, a detailed exploration of its moderating or mediating role in the social media-academic performance relationship, drawing on a broader range of evidence, will be beneficial.</p><p>This paper will therefore synthesize existing literature to systematically examine the relationship between social media use, time management, and academic performance among university students. Specifically, it will aim to characterize prevalent patterns of social media use among university students, analyze the documented effects of social media use on students' time management practices, and evaluate the overall impact of social media use and time management on academic performance.</p><h2>Review Method</h2><p>This paper presents a narrative synthesis of the evidence available to the writing run for the stated research question. The run assembled 30 distinct source records from OpenAlex. This is the available source pool, not the number of studies ultimately cited or a count from a systematic screening process. The synthesis draws on the metadata and source excerpts supplied by those records; access to every full text is not assumed. It compares reported relationships, differences in study contexts and methods, and limitations relevant to the research question. This is not an exhaustive or systematic review: no predefined screening protocol, independent double screening, comprehensive search coverage, or formal risk-of-bias assessment is claimed. Source identity checks and claim-support checks are separate, and remaining uncertainties are retained as review flags. No original participants were recruited, new dataset collected, or original statistical analysis performed for this literature-based paper.</p><h2>Thematic Literature Review</h2><p>Social media platforms have become ubiquitous in the lives of university students, influencing their academic experiences in complex ways <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="72f2a64d-cfbe-4902-9419-e46940a38125" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S1&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S1&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;50c0f715-5ed4-66e3-96d9-0b8fb9aa09d6&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7168081275&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7168081275&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Time Spent on Social Media and its Impact on Academic Performance: Evidence from University Students in Sargodha, Pakistan&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ojs.pssr.org.pk/journal/article/download/1159/947&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.35484/pssr.2025(9-iv)22&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Halema Sadia, Muhammad Hassan Babar, Zunaira Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sadia&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Halema&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Halema Sadia&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0009-0008-4477-3319&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sargodha&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Babar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Hassan&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Hassan Babar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Lahore&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Zunaira&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Zunaira Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sargodha&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Pakistan Social Sciences Review&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;9&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;IV&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S1&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S1]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S4&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;4286b9f9-2462-9531-fc7d-9ff6094dcb6c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7164532107&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7164532107&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Influence of Social Media Usage on Students&#39; Academic Performance and Study Habits&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Saroj&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;European Organization for Nuclear Research&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S4]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S14&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S14&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;92275dfc-7b38-ac80-1b93-82662b86b3af&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7204948599&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7204948599&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Assessment of Social Media Addiction, Academic Stress, and Mental Health among College and University Students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.66572/ejimapss.2026.v6.i2.99131&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.66572/ejimapss.2026.v6.i2.99131&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:null,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;European Journal of Integrative Medicinal and Allied Paramedical Spectrum Studies&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;6&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S14&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S14]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Sadia, Babar and Ghaffar, 2025; Chaudhary, 2026; European Journal of Integrative Medicinal and Allied Paramedical Spectrum Studies, 2026)</cite>. The prevailing literature indicates a nuanced relationship, where both beneficial and detrimental impacts are observed depending on the nature and extent of social media engagement.</p><p>### Patterns of Social Media Use<br>University students frequently engage with social media for a variety of purposes, including entertainment, communication, and information sharing <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="cfed4174-383a-40ad-b809-f1c26e801231" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S1&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S1&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;50c0f715-5ed4-66e3-96d9-0b8fb9aa09d6&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7168081275&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7168081275&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Time Spent on Social Media and its Impact on Academic Performance: Evidence from University Students in Sargodha, Pakistan&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ojs.pssr.org.pk/journal/article/download/1159/947&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.35484/pssr.2025(9-iv)22&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Halema Sadia, Muhammad Hassan Babar, Zunaira Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sadia&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Halema&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Halema Sadia&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0009-0008-4477-3319&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sargodha&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Babar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Hassan&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Hassan Babar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Lahore&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Zunaira&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Zunaira Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sargodha&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Pakistan Social Sciences Review&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;9&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;IV&q