ll,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Anuar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sarudin&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hassan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;UiTM Institutional Repositories (Universiti Teknologi MARA)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universiti Teknologi MARA&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S17]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S19&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S19&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;8d8c5542-a8d2-b422-a385-0d2006c0bf96&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W3203342489&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W3203342489&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Impact of smartphone usage on academic performance: a study on undergraduates in FMSC of University of Sri Jayewardenepura, Sri Lanka&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.4038/jm.v15i1.7593&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.4038/jm.v15i1.7593&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Nirmal Chathuranga, J. M. D. P. Jaysundara&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Chathuranga&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nirmal&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Nirmal Chathuranga&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9263-9239&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sri Jayewardenepura&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Jaysundara&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;J. M. D. P.&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;J. M. D. P. Jaysundara&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sri Jayewardenepura&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2020,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Journal of Management&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;15&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;14&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S19&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S19]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Chathuranga and Jaysundara, 2020; Ciroma, Abubakar and Bashir, 2025; Duc, 2025; Hajar et al., 2025; Sadia, Babar and Ghaffar, 2025; Sari et al., 2025; Ajubiga et al., 2026; Chaudhary, 2026; OMI UJUANBI and Omolegho, 2026; European Journal of Integrative Medicinal and Allied Paramedical Spectrum Studies, 2026)</cite>. This can manifest as procrastination and inconsistency in study habits <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="79d14ee7-8a1c-4174-9f17-35cb33eca292" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S13&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S13&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;35af1ecd-c552-446e-9486-334fa2d31122&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W4414553366&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W4414553366&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Patterns, Perceptions, and Academic Implications of Social Media Use among Tertiary Institution Students in Yobe State, Nigeria&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ejournal.yasin-alsys.org/AMJSAI/article/download/7482/5600&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.58578/amjsai.v2i3.7482&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Zainab Ibrahim Ciroma, Abdulkadir Musa Abubakar, Abdulkarim Bello Bashir&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ciroma&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Zainab Ibrahim&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Zainab Ibrahim Ciroma&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Abubakar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Abdulkadir Musa&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Abdulkadir Musa Abubakar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Federal Polytechnic Damaturu&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Bashir&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Abdulkarim Bello&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Abdulkarim Bello Bashir&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0577-5801&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;African Multidisciplinary Journal of Sciences and Artificial Intelligence&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;508-520&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S13&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S13]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S18&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S18&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;23149398-8c1f-f9c1-c3d3-75bd92c86d4c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7223089430&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7223089430&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Effect of Fear of Missing Out (FoMO) on Academic Procrastination among Undergraduate Students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.17605/osf.io/mvaqy&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.17605/osf.io/mvaqy&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Danish Ara, Rizky Putra Santosa&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ara&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Danish&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Danish Ara&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0009-0008-0329-0716&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Santosa&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Rizky Putra&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rizky Putra Santosa&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4465-3770&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;OSF Preprints (OSF Preprints)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;preprint&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Center for Open Science&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S18&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S18]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Ciroma, Abubakar and Bashir, 2025; Ara and Santosa, 2026)</cite>. For instance, students who consciously manage their social media time tend to perform better academically <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="029136a7-5152-4f8e-a771-b9da67710214" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S4&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;4286b9f9-2462-9531-fc7d-9ff6094dcb6c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7164532107&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7164532107&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Influence of Social Media Usage on Students&#39; Academic Performance and Study Habits&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Saroj&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;European Organization for Nuclear Research&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S4]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S5&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S5&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;40107c2c-646d-7872-050b-107a4a66b1e9&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W2992858501&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W2992858501&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Revealing the Relationship between Smartphone Addiction and Academic Performance of Students: Evidences from Higher Educational Institutes of Pakistan&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W2992858501&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:null,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam Khan, Asma Khalid, Rimsha Iqbal&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam Khan&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khalid&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Asma&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Asma Khalid&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3919-2487&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Iqbal&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Rimsha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rimsha Iqbal&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4685-2834&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2019,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Social Science Open Access Repository (GESIS – Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;74-83&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;GESIS - Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S5&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S5]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Chaudhary, 2026)</cite>. The constant drive to remain digitally connected, fueled by phenomena like the Fear of Missing Out (FoMO), can impair cognitive focus and redirect study time <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="59877e87-b8ab-4462-9f07-7ed2b8295d73" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S18&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S18&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;23149398-8c1f-f9c1-c3d3-75bd92c86d4c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7223089430&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7223089430&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Effect of Fear of Missing Out (FoMO) on Academic Procrastination among Undergraduate Students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.17605/osf.io/mvaqy&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.17605/osf.io/mvaqy&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Danish Ara, Rizky Putra Santosa&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ara&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Danish&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Danish Ara&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0009-0008-0329-0716&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Santosa&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Rizky Putra&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rizky Putra Santosa&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4465-3770&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;OSF Preprints (OSF Preprints)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;preprint&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Center for Open Science&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S18&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S18]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Ara and Santosa, 2026)</cite>. While some students exhibit resilience and effective time management despite considerable social media use, sleep deprivation due to prolonged engagement is also a concern <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="5cd211a0-c881-4330-b711-2f3dd89d50aa" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S10&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S10&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;df653c18-d4a9-d160-3265-f92776296c0a&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W4405879829&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W4405879829&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Impact of social media on higher education: Academic performance, leadership and co-curricular activity engagement&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://malque.pub/ojs/index.php/mr/article/download/5665/3193&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.31893/multirev.2025142&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Al Amin Mohamed Sultan, Erwan Ismail, Mohd Shamsuri Md Saad, Afifuddin Husairi Hussain, Muhammad Zaid Daud, Haitham M. Alswat&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sultan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Al Amin Mohamed&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Al Amin Mohamed Sultan&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7063-2706&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universiti Teknikal Malaysia Melaka&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ismail&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Erwan&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Erwan Ismail&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1706-1394&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universiti Teknikal Malaysia Melaka&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Saad&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Shamsuri Md&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mohd Shamsuri Md Saad&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2269-5494&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universiti Teknikal Malaysia Melaka&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hussain&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Afifuddin Husairi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Afifuddin Husairi Hussain&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5447-9828&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;National University of Malaysia&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Daud&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Zaid&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Zaid Daud&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4394-5181&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;National University of Malaysia&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Alswat&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Haitham M.&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Haitham M. Alswat&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5032-9259&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Shaqra University&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2024,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Multidisciplinary Reviews&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;8&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;5&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;2025142&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S10&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S10]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S14&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S14&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;92275dfc-7b38-ac80-1b93-82662b86b3af&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7204948599&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7204948599&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Assessment of Social Media Addiction, Academic Stress, and Mental Health among College and University Students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.66572/ejimapss.2026.v6.i2.99131&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.66572/ejimapss.2026.v6.i2.99131&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:null,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;European Journal of Integrative Medicinal and Allied Paramedical Spectrum Studies&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;6&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S14&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S14]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Sultan et al., 2024; European Journal of Integrative Medicinal and Allied Paramedical Spectrum Studies, 2026)</cite>.</p><p>### Effects on Academic Performance<br>The relationship between social media use and academic performance is multifaceted. Several studies indicate a negative correlation between excessive or non-academic social media use and academic achievement <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="81385256-a90b-40cd-8be7-6d71004dba77" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S1&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S1&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;50c0f715-5ed4-66e3-96d9-0b8fb9aa09d6&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7168081275&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7168081275&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Time Spent on Social Media and its Impact on Academic Performance: Evidence from University Students in Sargodha, Pakistan&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ojs.pssr.org.pk/journal/article/download/1159/947&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.35484/pssr.2025(9-iv)22&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Halema Sadia, Muhammad Hassan Babar, Zunaira Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sadia&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Halema&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Halema Sadia&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0009-0008-4477-3319&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sargodha&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Babar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Hassan&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Hassan Babar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Lahore&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Zunaira&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Zunaira Ghaffar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sargodha&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Pakistan Social Sciences Review&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;9&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;IV&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;: