ta Sari&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Diva&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Andini Tiara&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Andini Tiara Diva&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Styaningrum&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Fani Kusuma&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Fani Kusuma Styaningrum&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Gaoma&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Akin Witri&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Akin Witri Gaoma&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Fawnia&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nabila Olga&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Nabila Olga Fawnia&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nugraha&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Joko Tri&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Joko Tri Nugraha&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5220-9389&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;ANTASENA Governance and Innovation Journal&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;223-238&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universitas Krisnadwipayana&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S8&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S8]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Sari et al., 2025; Chaudhary, 2026)</cite>. Conversely, moderate and academic-oriented social media use can positively influence academic performance by facilitating collaborative learning, discussion, and knowledge sharing <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="78d3ba7