im Ali&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Sialkot&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Sociology &amp; Cultural Research Review&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S21&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S21]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Al-Rahmi, Othman and Musa, 2014; Ciroma, Abubakar and Bashir, 2025; Sari et al., 2025; Ajubiga et al., 2026; Chaudhary, 2026; Humza et al., 2026; OMI UJUANBI and Omolegho, 2026; Sunday, Adie and Egaga, 2026)</cite>. Academic-oriented use of platforms like YouTube and WhatsApp for research and collaborative learning can improve academic outcomes <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="55d5c5f3-90fd-4b9b-bbab-326b44a6d20f" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S16&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S16&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;b7c5a4a9-3509-ab69-5509-21e55e6d4790&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7202289713&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7202289713&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Impact of AI and social media usage on academic performance among undergraduates in the University of Calabar, Cross River State, Nigeria&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://akasa.com.ng/ojs/index.php/journal/article/download/567/628&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.64726/f7xake82&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Maria Ofie Sunday, Rose Unwanung Adie, Musa Moses Egaga&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sunday&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Maria Ofie&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Maria Ofie Sunday&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6704-2967&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Calabar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Adie&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Rose Unwanung&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rose Unwanung Adie&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Calabar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Egaga&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Musa Moses&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Musa Moses Egaga&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Calabar&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Aminu Kano Academic Scholars Association Multidisciplinary Journal&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;5&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;78-96&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S16&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S16]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S25&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S25&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;71207aaa-b729-6615-b682-d4b9007c3732&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W4299286459&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W4299286459&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Digital Resources Usage and Academic Performance of Undergraduate Students in Nigeria: A Case Study&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.ejimed.com/download/digital-resources-usage-and-academic-performance-of-undergraduate-students-in-nigeria-a-case-study-12491.pdf&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.30935/ejimed/12491&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Kolawole Francis Ogunbodede, Chinelo Blessing Oribhabor&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ogunbodede&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Kolawole Francis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Kolawole Francis Ogunbodede&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5518-7787&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Africa Toru-Orua&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Oribhabor&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Chinelo Blessing&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chinelo Blessing Oribhabor&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7318-1477&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Africa Toru-Orua&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2022,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;European Journal of Interactive Multimedia and Education&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;e02213&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S25&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S25]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Ogunbodede and Oribhabor, 2022; Sunday, Adie and Egaga, 2026)</cite>. The impact of social media, therefore, depends less on the platform itself and more on how students utilize it, emphasizing the importance of digital self-discipline and effective time management skills <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="72c13c11-60ae-40e8-b6a0-044f9ba57879" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S4&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;4286b9f9-2462-9531-fc7d-9ff6094dcb6c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7164532107&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7164532107&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Influence of Social Media Usage on Students&#39; Academic Performance and Study Habits&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Saroj&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Saroj Chaudhary&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;European Organization for Nuclear Research&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S4]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S5&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S5&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;40107c2c-646d-7872-050b-107a4a66b1e9&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W2992858501&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W2992858501&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Revealing the Relationship between Smartphone Addiction and Academic Performance of Students: Evidences from Higher Educational Institutes of Pakistan&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W2992858501&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:null,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam Khan, Asma Khalid, Rimsha Iqbal&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Arooba Azam Khan&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khalid&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Asma&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Asma Khalid&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3919-2487&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Iqbal&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Rimsha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rimsha Iqbal&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4685-2834&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2019,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Social Science Open Access Repository (GESIS – Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;74-83&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;GESIS - Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S5&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S5]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S6&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S6&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;72f1aa6d-fb39-a505-5a73-267dd9bd3c35&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7108663441&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7108663441&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;THE IMPACT OF SOCIAL MEDIA ON STUDENTS&#39; ACADEMIC PERFORMANCE IN UNIVERSITY DEGREE COLLEGES: A STUDY OF KUMAUN UNIVERSITY NAINITAL&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17811611&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.5281/zenodo.17811610&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Meeta Joshi, Manu Singh&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Joshi&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Meeta&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Meeta Joshi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Shri Venkateshwara University&quot;,&quot;Sri Venkateswara University&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Singh&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Manu&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Manu Singh&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Shri Venkateshwara University&quot;,&quot;Sri Venkateswara University&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;European Organization for Nuclear Research&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S6&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S6]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S13&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S13&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;35af1ecd-c552-446e-9486-334fa2d31122&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W4414553366&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W4414553366&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Patterns, Perceptions, and Academic Implications of Social Media Use among Tertiary Institution Students in Yobe State, Nigeria&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ejournal.yasin-alsys.org/AMJSAI/article/download/7482/5600&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.58578/amjsai.v2i3.7482&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Zainab Ibrahim Ciroma, Abdulkadir Musa Abubakar, Abdulkarim Bello Bashir&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ciroma&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Zainab Ibrahim&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Zainab Ibrahim Ciroma&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Abubakar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Abdulkadir Musa&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Abdulkadir Musa Abubakar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Federal Polytechnic Damaturu&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Bashir&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Abdulkarim Bello&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Abdulkarim Bello Bashir&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0577-5801&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;African Multidisciplinary Journal of Sciences and Artificial Intelligence&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;508-520&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S13&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S13]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S15&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S15&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;709df0c1-a94e-2623-9c06-ec42b7fd7158&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7117361642&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7117361642&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Excessive social media use and its impact on psychological well-being and academic performance of Vietnamese university students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.1080/02673843.2025.2608766&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.1080/02673843.2025.2608766&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh Duc&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Duc&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Tran Minh Duc&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Thu Dau Mot University&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;International Journal of Adolescence and Youth&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;31&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Taylor &amp; Francis&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S15&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S15]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S17&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;ee8ba2a6-8919-289d-c6c6-db153a2a7a3d&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7112829116&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7112829116&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The influence of TikTok on academic performance among university students at UiTM Alor Gajah, Melaka&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ir.uitm.edu.my/id/eprint/123523/1/123523.pdf&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:null,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Mat Said, Siti Hajar, Ahmad Hisham, Widad Nasuha, Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah, Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis, Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi, Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah, Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hajar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mat Said, Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nasuha&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ahmad Hisham, Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hussar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Anuar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sarudin&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hassan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;UiTM Institutional Repositories (Universiti Teknologi MARA)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universiti Teknologi MARA&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S17]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Ciroma, Abubakar and Bashir, 2025; Duc, 2025; Hajar et al., 2025; Joshi and Singh, 2025; Chaudhary, 2026)</cite>.</p><h2>Discussion</h2><p>The reviewed literature consistently highlights a complex and often contradictory relationship between social media use, time management, and academic performance among university students. A prominent pattern indicates that excessive and non-academic social media engagement generally correlates with negative academic outcomes <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="f8497cb5-1a87-45a9-afb2-86e21ffa5b2d" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S1&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S1&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;50c0f715-5ed4-66e3-96d9-0b8fb9aa09d6&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7168081275&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7168081275&qu