quot;:2019,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;Social Science Open Access Repository (GESIS – Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;74-83&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;GESIS - Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S5&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S5]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S8&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S8&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;591d68c3-f2a6-ea66-e088-d0c38c03bb5f&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W4411615407&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W4411615407&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Perspektif Mahasiswa terhadap Pengunaan Medsos dan Prestasi Belajar Mahasiswa&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://ejournal-fia.unkris.ac.id/index.php/antasena/article/download/335/230&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.61332/antasena.v3i1.335&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Diah Pita Sari, Andini Tiara Diva, Fani Kusuma Styaningrum, Akin Witri Gaoma, Nabila Olga Fawnia, Joko Tri Nugraha&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sari&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Diah Pita&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Diah Pita Sari&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Diva&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Andini Tiara&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Andini Tiara Diva&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Styaningrum&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Fani Kusuma&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Fani Kusuma Styaningrum&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Gaoma&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Akin Witri&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Akin Witri Gaoma&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Fawnia&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nabila Olga&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Nabila Olga Fawnia&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nugraha&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Joko Tri&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Joko Tri Nugraha&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5220-9389&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Universitas Tidar&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;ANTASENA Governance and Innovation Journal&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;223-238&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universitas Krisnadwipayana&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S8&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S8]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Sari et al., 2025; Chaudhary, 2026)</cite>. The constant drive for digital connection, exacerbated by phenomena like the Fear of Missing Out (FoMO), is identified as a factor impairing cognitive focus and diverting study time <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="cd4b1e62-a041-47c7-bf5e-1ae4a5a339a8" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S18&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S18&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;23149398-8c1f-f9c1-c3d3-75bd92c86d4c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7223089430&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7223089430&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Effect of Fear of Missing Out (FoMO) on Academic Procrastination among Undergraduate Students&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.17605/osf.io/mvaqy&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.17605/osf.io/mvaqy&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Danish Ara, Rizky Putra Santosa&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ara&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Danish&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Danish Ara&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0009-0008-0329-0716&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Santosa&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Rizky Putra&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rizky Putra Santosa&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4465-3770&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;OSF Preprints (OSF Preprints)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;preprint&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Center for Open Science&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S18&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S18]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Ara and Santosa, 2026)</cite>.</p><p>However, the literature also presents a significant contradiction: moderate and academic-oriented social media use can positively influence academic performance <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="dce66427-d3bc-401f-b060-68da79f7a0e5" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S2&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S2&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;28ce1149-4303-2730-e196-a95a7770bb92&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7160121679&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7160121679&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;EFFECTS OF SOCIAL MEDIA ON SCHOOL PERFORMANCE: AN INVESTIGATIVE STUDY OF UNDERGRADUATE STUDENTS IN EDO STATE&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.54922/ijehss.2026.1251&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.54922/ijehss.2026.1251&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;OMI UJUANBI, Gloria Omolegho&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;OMI UJUANBI&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:null,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;OMI UJUANBI&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Ambrose Alli University&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Omolegho&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Gloria&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Gloria Omolegho&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Ambrose Alli University&quot;]}],&quot;year&quot;:2026,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;International Journal of Education Humanities and Social Science&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:&quot;09&quot;,&quot;issue&quot;:&quot;02&quot;,&quot;pages&quot;:&quot;398-410&quot;,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:null,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S2&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S2]&quot;},{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S4&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S4&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;4286b9f9-2462-9531-fc7d-9ff6094dcb6c&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7164532107&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7164532107&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Influence of Social Media Usage on Students&#39; Academic Performance and Study Habits&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20669918&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;: