, Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Anuar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sarudin&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hassan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;UiTM Institutional Repositories (Universiti Teknologi MARA)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universiti Teknologi MARA&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S17]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Khan, Khalid and Iqbal, 2019; Ciroma, Abubakar and Bashir, 2025; Duc, 2025; Hajar et al., 2025; Joshi and Singh, 2025; Chaudhary, 2026)</cite>.</p><p>A key limitation across many studies is the reliance on self-reported data for social media use and academic performance <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="cd9e088d-2150-4e5f-a355-975781071bf2" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S15&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S15&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;709df0c1-a94e-2623-9c06-ec42b7fd7158&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7117361642&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quo