ad Nasuha, Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah, Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis, Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi, Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah, Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hajar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mat Said, Siti Hajar&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nasuha&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ahmad Hisham, Widad Nasuha&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hussar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hussar, Adlyn Nazurah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Anuar&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Anuar, Nur Ellesya Balqis&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Sarudin&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sarudin, Muhammad Faizi&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sah Allam, Siti Nurshahidah&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Hassan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Hassan, Mohd Sufiean&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]}],&quot;year&quot;:2025,&quot;venue&quot;:&quot;UiTM Institutional Repositories (Universiti Teknologi MARA)&quot;,&quot;volume&quot;:null,&quot;issue&quot;:null,&quot;pages&quot;:null,&quot;workType&quot;:&quot;article&quot;,&quot;publisher&quot;:&quot;Universiti Teknologi MARA&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;yearLabel&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S17&quot;},&quot;originalLabel&quot;:&quot;[S17]&quot;}]" data-narrative="false">(Duc, 2025; Hajar et al., 2025)</cite>, which may introduce biases. While some research acknowledges the moderating role of time management skills <cite data-citation-id="" data-occurrence-id="f9c57a44-fe16-4cef-ba03-4838f0469fef" data-items="[{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;fb7822bf-c876-49f5-9489-213f495ab409:S3&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:{&quot;sourceId&quot;:&quot;S3&quot;,&quot;canonicalId&quot;:&quot;b61186cc-2965-3b5d-70e0-de17b70d7e2d&quot;,&quot;openAlexWorkId&quot;:&quot;W7129271745&quot;,&quot;pmid&quot;:null,&quot;provider&quot;:&quot;OpenAlex&quot;,&quot;providerRecordId&quot;:&quot;https://openalex.org/W7129271745&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Productive and Problematic Social Media Use and Students’ Academic Outcomes: Mediation by Parent/Teacher Support and Moderation by Time Management Skills (Evidence from Higher Education Institutions in Punjab and Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan)&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://rjsaonline.com/journals/index.php/rjsa/article/download/715/893&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;web&quot;,&quot;passageStart&quot;:null,&quot;passageEnd&quot;:null,&quot;doi&quot;:&quot;10.71317/rjsa.003.06.0715&quot;,&quot;authors&quot;:&quot;Najma Tauheed, Muhammad Aslam Khan, Muhammad Siddique, Hafiz Safi Ullah, Haji Irfan Haider, Mahesh Kumar Oad&quot;,&quot;authorDetails&quot;:[{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Tauheed&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Najma&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Najma Tauheed&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Khan&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Aslam&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Aslam Khan&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:&quot;https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6219-3918&quot;,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;University of Haripur&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Siddique&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&quot;Muhammad&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Muhammad Siddique&quot;,&quot;orcid&quot;:null,&quot;affiliations&quot;:[&quot;Gomal University&quot;]},{&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Ullah&quot;,&quot;given&quot;:&